  "schema": "jovie.cert-screens/v1",
  "note": "Every component a listed screen's page can render must pass these criteria. debt holds what failed when a screen was enrolled; it only shrinks. Enroll and refresh with scripts/component-cert-screens.mjs, never by hand. Golden Path screens come from docs/pen-stills/golden-path/manifest.json.",
